  (text "4. METERING (BL0939)" (at 187.9600 36.8300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 819de234-f50d-48d0-b22f-777c2dc6e4f5))
  (text "UART address 5 (A1, A3 high; A2, A4 low): the firmware sends 0x55/0xA5, which encode address 5.\nDivider 5 x 390k + 470R: 230 V gives 55 mV rms, 290 V gives 70 mV rms (pin limit 70 mV rms). Firmware board file: div_r_bottom = 0.47 k.\nAlarms: CF (channel A, MODE[12]) OR I_LEAK (channel B) -> isolator channel E. Both active high." (at 187.9600 40.6400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 78677ab0-c3d8-486b-ab50-322c92a7855e))
